From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:36:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] TEST ONLY: arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: Enable the CPU PMU

For one gated measurement boot: enable the T8132 PMU node on the J604 so
the reference loops can count cycles, instructions, branches and loads on
an E and a P core and check the overflow interrupt. Not for a release
kernel: the node is enabled for good only after that measurement passes.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index be0892e107..638a4f5e2e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -345,6 +345,11 @@
 	};
 };
 
+/* TEST ONLY: the T8132 PMU event-placement measurement. */
+&cpu_pmu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &mtp {
 	status = "okay"; /* DTV-MTP-3..5 */
 };
